DENIAL REASON
This claim has been denied because prior authorization was not obtained before the service
was rendered. Cigna's clinical coverage policy requires prior authorization for diagnostic
cardiac catheterization procedures.

Our records do not show an active authorization on file for this service on the date
of service.

DENIAL CODE
This claim was processed with adjustment reason code CARC-15 (payment adjusted because
the submitted authorization number is missing, invalid, or does not apply to the billed
services or provider).

APPEAL RIGHTS
You have the right to appeal this decision. To initiate an appeal:
- Submit a written request within 180 days of this notice
- Include medical records supporting the necessity of the service
- Include any retrospective authorization documentation

If you believe an authorization was obtained in error, please contact Cigna Provider
Relations with documentation.

